Authenticated: Yes
Authentication Mechanism: Session-based (express-session with MongoDB store)
Primary Protected Routes: cart, payment, order (staff-only status updates), menu (staff operations)
JWT Middleware: Available in authJwt.js but not integrated into any routes
Demo Accounts: 3 students (PRN/password), 1 staff, 1 admin
Password Hashing: Salted SHA256 (consistent across codebase)
Email Validation: @sitpune.edu.in required for registration
Session Regeneration: Yes (prevents session fixation)
Cookie Security: httpOnly, secure in production, sameSite=lax
Rate Limiting: Not implemented
Brute-Force Protection: Not implemented